---

<section class="triangle-section">
  <div class="section-label">The Moat</div>
  <h2>Three tools. One reasoning system.</h2>
  <p class="section-desc">
    Parliament alone is a debate club — intellectually interesting but untethered. 
    Paired with ACR and Engram, it becomes a system that thinks before it acts.
  </p>

  <div class="triangle">
    <div class="node">
      <div class="node-icon">🎯</div>
      <h3>ACR</h3>
      <p class="node-role">Context</p>
      <p class="node-desc">Injects the right context at the right resolution — specs, capabilities, constraints.</p>
      <p class="without">Without it: Parliament deliberates in the abstract.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="node">
      <div class="node-icon">🧠</div>
      <h3>Engram</h3>
      <p class="node-role">Memory</p>
      <p class="node-desc">Feeds history, outcomes, and shared memory — past decisions, what worked, what broke.</p>
      <p class="without">Without it: Every deliberation starts cold.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="node">
      <div class="node-icon">⚖️</div>
      <h3>Parliament</h3>
      <p class="node-role">Judgment</p>
      <p class="node-desc">Structured disagreement that weighs tradeoffs, surfaces blind spots, and reaches decisions.</p>
      <p class="without">Without it: Context and memory without judgment.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="integration-flow">
    <h3>The Integration Story</h3>
    <ol>
      <li>Query lands: <em>"Should we change our architecture?"</em></li>
      <li><strong>ACR</strong> resolves what context matters — specs, capabilities, constraints</li>
      <li><strong>Engram</strong> pulls past decisions, known issues, what's been tried</li>
      <li><strong>Parliament</strong> deliberates with that context loaded</li>
      <li>Decision is recorded back to <strong>Engram</strong></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .triangle-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-desc {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 3rem;
  }

  .triangle {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .node {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: border-color 0.2s;
  }

  .node:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }

  .node-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .node h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .node-role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .node-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .without {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--red);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .integration-flow {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .integration-flow h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .integration-flow ol {
    list-style: none;
    counter-reset: step;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .integration-flow li {
    counter-increment: step;
    padding-left: 2.5rem;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .integration-flow li::before {
    content: counter(step);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
    width: 1.75rem;
    height: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .integration-flow li em {
    color: var(--text);
    font-style: normal;
  }
</style>
